## 2. Advanced Conditional: Finding the Largest of Three
**Logic:** Using logical AND (`&&`) to compare multiple variables simultaneously.

```text
START
  Input a, b, c
  IF (a >= b) AND (a >= c) THEN
     PRINT "a is largest"
  ELSE IF (b >= a) AND (b >= c) THEN
     PRINT "b is largest"
  ELSE
     PRINT "c is largest"
END
```

